# Gimnasio Mente (C6, contract 49), 15 x 15, interior. column = i, row = j. The user's mock "Gimnasio Mente": big pale ring slabs (`ring_<i%2><j%2>`, the city's plaza) and LOW GLASS PARTITIONS (`rail_i` / `rail_j`) between
# nine closed 4 x 4 rooms: teleport maze. The only way between rooms is a PAD (`P`, `@pad`): the entrance room is the bottom middle (door at (7..8,14)); the TRUE way is E -> R20 -> R10 -> R00 -> Dra. Sena's room
# (R01, top middle); the right-hand chain E -> R22 -> R12 -> R02 -> R11 (the centre) is a dead end. Seven psychic trainers, one per room (psiquico walk set: a trainer in a corner looks along the diagonal of its room and the two pads of the
# room are on opposite sides of it, so crossing the room is a fight). Win: `badge_mente` (85, the card's 6th badge, an EYE), Disc 07 (flag 854). Rooms (top-left corner): R00 (1,1) R01 (6,1) R02 (11,1) / R10 (1,6) R11 (6,6) R12 (11,6) / R20 (1,11) R21 (6,11) R22 (11,11).
@map gimnasio_mente
@size 15 15
@interior yes
@flag sena_disc 854   # Dra. Sena's Disc 07 was handed over (a full bag keeps it clear)
@bg 0
@fill ring_00
@spawn door 7 13 N
@legend
  .  tile=ring_01
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
